(Abstract: We present an empirical analysis of multi-head self-attention mechanisms.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(Our proposed Scaled Cosine Attention improves convergence speed by 18.4% on ImageNet-1K.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(Unlike standard dot-product attention, cosine normalization stabilizes gradient variance.) Tj
