(Section 1: Mathematical Formulation) Tj
0 -20 Td
(Given queries Q and keys K of dimension d_k, the attention weights are computed as:) Tj
0 -20 Td
(Attention(Q, K, V) = softmax( (Q * K^T) / sqrt(d_k) ) * V) Tj
0 -20 Td
(The computational complexity per layer is O(n^2 * d) where n is sequence length.) Tj
